To use the Virtual Fly Brain Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool, follow these steps:
1. Open Claude Desktop,
2. go to Settings,
3. navigate to the MCP section, and
4. add a new MCP server with the settings:
 - Server Name: virtual-fly-brain,
 - Type: HTTP,
 - Server URL: https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org.

Alternatively, you can use the Configuration JSON method or set up the tool with GitHub Copilot or other MCP-compatible clients.

```
{
"mcpServers": {
 "virtual-fly-brain": {
 "type": "http",
 "url": "https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org",
 "tools": ["*"]
 }
}
}
```
